Key RequirementsProduct Owner / Security Researcher
Strong hands-on cybersecurity background is the priority.
 Experience with XDR platforms is mandatory:
CrowdStrike
Microsoft Defender
SentinelOne
Experience with at least two of the three platforms is required.
The client prefers a security expert who can grow into a Product Owner role rather than an experienced Product Owner without deep security expertise.
Product VisionThe product will follow a proven market approach by building on established XDR solutions such as CrowdStrike and Microsoft Defender rather than creating a completely new concept.
AI is heavily integrated into the development process. Code generation is largely AI-assisted, while engineers focus on reviewing generated code, defining requirements, and solving complex technical problems.
Hiring PreferencesPreference for Ukrainian specialists located in Ukraine or Poland.
Office attendance is preferred, with hybrid flexibility depending on stakeholder availability.
Next StepsAndrii will provide the full list of open positions by the end of this week.
Kateryna will prepare market research on salaries and recruitment service pricing.
The budget must be finalized by the end of July 2026.
After Phase 2 budget approval, the parties will sign the recruitment agreement and sourcing will begin.', 'OK', '2026-07-07 07:48'),
