  (174051928290::bigint, 173518525627::bigint, null::bigint, null::bigint, 'As promised I am connecting you Jake Arnold-Forster CEO and co-founder of Carradale Futures which I chair. The business owns and operates a platform that helps client organisations to standardise, improve and audit their standard operating procedures (SOPs).  Carradale’s platform enables these organisations to rapidly create a detailed digital blueprint of their processes - a foundational step to effective automation. Onboarding is quick and easy with AI assisted transformation of existing governance and process documentation.

