  (125630740679::bigint, 16160214231::bigint, null::bigint, 13291113194::bigint, '22/01 John''s Notes:

Just with Steve West at an Exec Change event. He has quite an urgent need for a Senior Microsoft Navision developer, to help them in their migration from Navision to Dynamics….. Can we find someone suitably experienced to help them in taht journey? He says its a very real and funded requirement, will be able to share a job description early next week. 

