Yes its Dreams Furniture https://www.dreams.co.uk , we have been talking to them for a while as former GT client and friend Steve West went there. THis will be first engagement with them. Dreams are a reputable and quite large furniture retailer (200 stores nation wide), they are owned by an even larger US group company. So quite significant and good for us to have another retail client


From Steve: Just had this back from Bart
