  (83801334972::bigint, 35974896876::bigint, null::bigint, 33230436563::bigint, 'JH Notes from Lending point call

Raul Tavares - lending point, 10 years, building the products and the sales team. Creating demand, funding the loan ot the consumer, all sits under Raul
Amzad Hossain - lending point 3.5 years,
