Chalenge is if we are breaking down those end points we end up completely shutting down this system
So how is system designed currently, how can we optimise rather than completely remodel these pieces?
And we can look at what our options are beyond Salesforce...
Salesforce CRM, but a lot of their Appex library....
Really getting concerned about the use of their product
