  (64104472800::bigint, 23190147038::bigint, null::bigint, 9179517116::bigint, '22/10 CALL NOTES

Staffing and Hiring Needs:
Need for skilled BI Analysts and data experts. They explored options to hire talent that would be more cost-effective than existing options, including remote and flexible staffing arrangements.
There''s a desire to avoid expensive contractors in the U.S., preferring elastic support models to manage costs and resources more effectively.
IT Integration and Migration Challenges:
One of the main challenges is the IT integration between the new sites, which involves migrating from SAP (the system used by the new sites) to Microsoft''s Business Central (the system used by KD Pharma).
Paul mentioned that this migration needs to be completed within nine months, which he anticipates will be a difficult process, referring to it as a "year of hell" due to the complexities of aligning different systems and data.
Issues with Current Systems:
The SAP system used at the acquired sites is outdated (ECC 6) and will be end-of-life by 2030. Rather than investing in upgrading to S/4HANA, KD Pharma has opted to integrate everything into Microsoft Business Central, which aligns with their broader strategy as a "Microsoft house."
Paul noted that KD Pharma''s team is small, which adds to the difficulty of managing these IT projects and integrations efficiently.
Data and Reporting Needs:
Data integration and reporting are major focuses, as there are ongoing challenges with managing data across multiple systems and ensuring accurate, consistent reports for management.
Paul identified a need for additional business intelligence (BI) analysts, preferably with a blend of technical and business acumen, to help streamline reporting and address data issues.
Cost and Staffing Strategies:
Paul emphasized the need for cost-effective solutions, mentioning that hiring contractors in the U.S. had proven too expensive. He expressed interest in exploring flexible staffing models that could provide skilled resources at a more reasonable price, potentially from countries like Ukraine.
He also described the previous data reporting setup as "amateur hour," indicating that there was a lack of structure and professionalism in the way reports were generated, further underscoring the need for more skilled BI staff.
KD Pharma is facing a period of significant transformation, with IT and data integration being critical areas that require careful management and additional resources.', 'VS', '2024-10-23 08:54'),
