  (35675782083::bigint, null::bigint, 31593348312::bigint, 11397215179::bigint, 'Contact overview:
Director of Information Technology Operations
Current Role: Leading IT operations at Ambry Genetics since April 2024.
Location: Michigan, United States (Remote)
Key Responsibilities:
Overseeing system administration, DevOps, and automation processes.
Managing service desk operations and ensuring efficient end-user support.
Supervising database operations and IT infrastructure.
