Enhance test reliability through meticulous attention to small, passing tests and gradually expanding coverage.
Integrate automated tests seamlessly into our CI/CD pipeline (GitHub) to facilitate continuous testing.
Manage and optimise test case repositories in BrowserStack, enhancing visibility and reporting.
Monitor test results in Sentry, swiftly identifying issues and collaborating with the development team to resolve them.
Cultivate a culture of ownership in QA automation, fostering continuous improvement across the team.
How you will grow:
