Dear all,
 
I hope this call finds you well.
 
It has been a while since we last engaged and I owe you some news.
 
The relative lack of “fresh money” or willingness to further invest in the tech package discussed during our last call meant I decided to alter the course and substance of the company hence my role &amp; input.
 
We reoriented our services around data management topics to CIO advisory, IT strategy and roadmaps, introduction of Generative IA at board level with HR impacts…
 
I currently support a large IT/industrial Project for future products at NovoNordisk as Program Director and will potentially engage with International Tech delivery &amp; services companies (similar to yours) as Sales &amp; Delivery Director for the European regional from September onwards.
 
iMi will continue but my route will probably diverge.
 
Please feel free to call, send info or more should you think I could be an ambassador to your Value Proposition in the future.
 
Best regards and great day to all!', 'MB', '2024-05-13 07:34'),
  (27749455847::bigint, null::bigint, 25705::bigint, 9179532527::bigint, 'Jurij connected with John, cuz generated from his LN.
