  (25077849040::bigint, null::bigint, null::bigint, 10015904191::bigint, '01/03 CALL NOTES

Introduction:
Kaz (Caroline): Heading up a high throughput screening and automation team at Immunocore, with a background in molecular biology, microbiology, assay development, and high throughput screening. She has extensive experience in the biologics and pharmaceutical industry.
Sean Buckley: CIO at Immunocore, with two decades of experience in biotech, focusing on smaller companies and having a broad involvement in IT and data management.
Kia: R&amp;D data consultant at Immunocore, with a background in pharmacology, immunopharmacology, and computational biology. He has experience in scientific data management systems, laboratory information management systems, and electronic notebooks.
Jakub: A principal scientist at Immunocore with ten years of experience at the company. He is a protein engineer interested in advancing science through digital innovations.
Next Steps:Vika to send Immunocore additional information about GT services, case studies, and reports on AI and machine learning applications.
Vika to schedule another call in a week or ten days to discuss potential collaboration further, based on Immunocore''s review of the provided materials and their internal discussions on how GT Life Sciences can assist with their data and machine learning challenges.', 'VS', '2024-03-01 09:23'),
