  (25039866055::bigint, null::bigint, 64851::bigint, null::bigint, '(Sales Nav) John Harris to Catherine Michel:
Hello Catherine
 
I would like the opportunity to talk to you to see if you are interested in taking a seat on one of our Executive CIO Advisory Boards run by Executive Change.  I am sure you would know many of our team as they are all former CxOs and have typically spent most of their lives on your side of the desk and include former CxOs from organisations such as HBOS, Barclays, O2, GSK, Time Warner etc.  
 
We have a portfolio of Boards that we manage on behalf Global vendors such as Cisco, Fujitsu, VMware, Netcompany, ServiceNow and Computacenter and several opportunities are currently available. 
 
Membership is by invitation only and a Charter exists to ensure the professional operation of the Boards.  The Boards offer prestigious networking and interesting debates and we always provide a charitable honorarium in recognition of our Board Members’ time commitment.  Over the past years have raised thousands for various charities chosen by our members.
 
More details are attached and if you could let me know if you would be happy to have a 10-15 minute telco to discuss your potential involvement and the right opportunity for you, it would be much appreciated.
 
I look forward to hearing from you.
 
Kind Regards
 
John


John Harris', 'JH', '2023-04-20 10:17'),
