  (24828150500::bigint, null::bigint, 52001::bigint, null::bigint, '(LinkedIn) John Harris to John Rugge, CISSP:
Hi John,

A brief pre-Xmas note to update you since we were last in touch. After launching our healthcare division GT LifeScience in September, we’ve already delivered a pivotal data solution for a leading group of private eye hospitals, streamlining operations and significantly enhancing patient care.
