  (23793247468::bigint, null::bigint, 48251::bigint, 9643523059::bigint, 'Kahle Automation http://www.KahleAutomation.com - Dedicated to Providing Custom Automation Solutions for the Medical Device, Pharmaceutical &amp; Healthcare Industry
2022 - BBS Automation (industry: Machinery Manufacturing) acquired Kahle Automation for an undisclosed amount
Kahle Automation products and services:
Platforms:
Continuous Motion Assembly (allow you to assemble products while also performing quality inspections as the product moves through the assembly process);
