  (22226626507::bigint, null::bigint, 18501::bigint, 8814714049::bigint, '24/10 John''s CALL NOTES:
Gave Gt intro overall

Dr Sylvia Barker - PHD in magnetic resonance with specialism in lab technology
So bringing normal lab activities into a micro basis. So chemical reactionscombined with magnetic resonance to gain real time comprehensive insigh from these insighst

Currently trying to found a start up called Microvita, focussing on how poor data quality is

Organ models on a chip now emerging but data quality is low or its difficult to obtain the data
So we combine the advancing vitro models where magnetic resonance gives an antlernate way of getting metabolic data non invasively, lets you see how the medicine combines with invitro models in real time

Experts in magnetic resonance but the goal will be to combine a fully integrated automated service w here you can then integrate MS and other snesing techniques to get a whole picture of how a medicine reacts with the invitro mdoel to get the best understanding.....

trying to get funding currently, applying for grant funding, was on Icure program, which funds commercialisation of university research, at the final stage of receiving a grant that gets that going
Got a study lined up with 2N pharma, also got a letter of intent from Astra Zeneca....

Really been focussed on getting out to customers and makign sure that we have the right pipelien on the customer side of the company, ensure there is a real need for what we are doing

