Customers are typically heads of discovery or folks focussing on advanced invitro models within the business....

Dedicated divisions doing this in the big pharma companies, have spoken to 14 out of 20 of the biggest, they all have major problems getting data out of invitro models......

The only company that enables the integration of a large number of invitro models with magnetic resonance. There is one other company that does this but only wiht single cells whereas we can work with single cells, clsuters and tissue.....

So vision is that there will be a product underpinened by tech

