Currently battling the university as want an unreasonable share in the business. Univeristy needs to approve that they allow the right share for the funding to go through.....

Currently building machine learning algorithms, rudimentarily in our labs but will need to build software on top of that in the future.....

Potentially in the roadmpa for the next funding round is data engineering and AI, so we are well placed.....

Invite to future events, keep in touch, but v much one for the future not for today', 'VS', '2023-12-01 03:55'),
