  (21771854013::bigint, 7545011960::bigint, null::bigint, 7624428751::bigint, '15/11 PHONE CALL NOTES - it was a follow-up call with John on HOC event

Client''s intro: Zvi was involved in Israel in a startup that did GenAI for Menopause. He is a consultant gynecologist, heading the project as a medical director. Left it as he had a conflict of interest as he was in UK and wants to do the same thing for the UK for psychiatrists, in line with MyOgenes. He has a base of so many psychiatrists that they work with, so its a waste not to build and create a similar platform. So want to develop (maybe separate funding to MyOgenes) to develop and evolve a platform based on the platform on menopause, so at the minute it answers general questions on menopause, pretty easy to do as you just use data-approved by the medical world, so it''s not Chat GPT like.

Then the second piece is a very personal questionnaire for that particular patient, such things exist and following that questionnaire, the consultant gets a summary report which saves a lot of them, so in a consultation of one hour you can get the data in 5 minutes. And you can do a video consultation that follows up. And the follow-up is key, to ensure folks know how to take the tablets etc. So then use Gen AI to have a very clear response to the patient''s questions etc.... And of course, then implement genetic testing and pharmacogenomics,
HAs partners who can help software companies in Israel.

So wants to understand if we can design and build such a platform, of course, there will be some funding required, want to know what we would need to do.  He has candidates ready to invest in this app (but not yet certain). He expects it to become a crowded market, but in psychiatry has a lot of advantages and capabilities in the UK.

JH explained: you would need medically qualified data from clinicians, then we design it into a suitable data schema and then add an SDK for natural language capability over the top of it. And then recognize that the app will need to learn and be taught on the medical accuracy.

Zvi said: "I like you and GT, and really trust you, so need to work out on the exact project that we want to do, may start small, but would want to work with you. "

Will look for a small and tight use case initially.
Will come back to us when he is further ready.....

John indicated that we could move quite quick and kick off early in the new year, combination of Artem up front and then backed up by suitable team of engineers when needed.

Next steps: Zvi to come back to us probably in a month or 6 weeks when ready to have kick off call to explore technical proposal in more depth.', 'VS', '2023-11-15 08:16'),
