  (20482339025::bigint, null::bigint, 15051::bigint, 8600461553::bigint, 'Hi Jonathan, I think we connected many years back when I was at GSK; we clearly have a shared passion for life science innovation anyway!  With that in mind, we have an interesting event coming up that you might want to attend, details as follows: On behalf of GT, our kind sponsor Sarah Green, MP Amersham and Chesham invites you to join us for a summer evening of drinks and nibbles in Terrace Dining Room A in the iconic House of Commons. During this Life Science and MedTech futures event, organised by Executive Change, three expert panels will discuss how deep domain insights and excellence in technology need to combine, in order to impact the next wave of transformation in life sciences. Our speakers will include John Harris (CTO at GT, former chief architect and head of innovation at GSK), Andy Baynes (CEO at GT and former Nest, Apple and Google executive) and Kristin Bickett (Head of Channel Operations, Industry Partnerships at Google). Let me know if you are interested. CHeers, John H
