  (18024102874::bigint, 7544967618::bigint, 2901::bigint, 7457037498::bigint, 'Gemma Rhodes-Cheong - been with Optegra about 6 months in finance helping with BI and data projects. Perviously in Amazon so very expeirenced in data
Ola Bielen
Running country set up in how we run and reconcile
EDW based on Azure factory, on top of that then Power BI in terms of reporting
Each country has their own data warehouse based on the same arhcitecture,
Some independent, variety of on premise and SAAS
Typicaly try and get data schema, connet actually data, run ETL and full maintenance across EDW
Outsourced managed service running EDW
But then a separate service building the Power BI services
In Poland had some challenges, used our Czech counterparts who already built a data ware house for Czech, did the same for Poland,
CHallenge in buiding out the right data sets to then reconcile back intothe right data sources
Have the EDW ready, need to connect he right data sources, still needs to be worked through depending on the reporing elemenets.
WHat we have as a gap is the reporitng capability in Power BI and Analytics, want someone to look at data in our data warehouse and then ensure that we have a roadmap based on where we are trying to get to help us to map out the data and build the reporitng based on that....
Gemma - main challenge in Poland is we have some raw daata, need help reconciling that to the reports we get directly from the system, so need help to validate that is working and then help setting up Power BI services and reports....
How much do they change?
5 key reports we need to set up and keep running, but then after that its ad hoc..... Getting to the 5 reports and key areas is a long roadmap....
Polish language capabiltiy is important.
The EDW team currently is Czech, the systems and data are polish, so some polish language capabiluty is key.....
So need to speak to some of the data providers downstream in Poland as well so ened to work in Polish there. And probably work with the Czech team who provides the EDW....
Probably a couple of engineers on the data warehouse side,
Data analyst, who would be able to do the mapping of the data between the data sources, all the validity checking
Checking the data into the Power BI, then an engineer who can communicate advise and check we have all the connectiviyt of the daata.
Then we have our financial system where the data will slightly change and need to be connected wtih additional feeds as well.
So strong patnership with teh EDW partner but we need engineering
SQL database in Azure
For the initial analysis, try and scope out the project, understnd the current set up, challenges etc.... could Sul do this?
ie understand and
Do have some documentation, that is in English, so we can understand that in English, look at the roadmap of what we are trying to achieve, that helps us get faster to the proposal....
SO key intro, the third party INtecs who are managing the EDW, then alos Sheman Bet, this is one of the third party providers who has been working and supporting on a number of hours throughout this journey, so use the session with this person to ask the questions without letting on we might be taking over.....
2 or 3 month project, 2 or 3 engineers, then a Power BI person ongoing.
Look at it commercially based on outcomes, ie agree first outcome is data sets validated and connecteed, second one build out commercial funnel output, so we have specific tangible outcomes etc. etc.
Need to be very clear on requirements and deliverables on both sides....
No scope creep, clarity on deliverables....', 'JH', '2023-09-13 06:17'),
  (17996178405::bigint, 7544896729::bigint, 5901::bigint, 8432365028::bigint, 'Whatsapp exchange between John and Atima 5th June 2023:
