  (17740400342::bigint, null::bigint, 4762::bigint, 7667377363::bigint, 'Hi Mariana Thanks for your email and follow up. I will pass on your request to our engineering team. On a separate note, I may have an opportunity for some of those resources with an unrelated company that I’m having discussions with. Would you have availability today or tomorrow to discuss some more regarding the commercial arrangement?BestGary', 'MK', '2020-05-21 03:22'),
  (17740644051::bigint, 7545096917::bigint, 4643::bigint, 7667816934::bigint, 'Eric is Castor''s Talent Acquisition Manager and is keen to speak to you about potentially growing an extended team in Kyiv.

Castor is an amazing company that uses Data Science to expedite medical research. The hope is that their platform will lead to, for example, create a COVID-19 vaccine faster than it was possible before', 'MK', '2020-05-21 00:43'),
  (17740570813::bigint, null::bigint, 4762::bigint, 7667377363::bigint, 'reconnect in 2 weeks.
he has a project on a side with his colleague and they are looking for 3ETMs - Python, Javascript, PostgreSQL, AWS experience; data engineers would be good (weather data, political data)
Currently it is a small team.', 'MK', '2020-05-22 04:54'),
  (17740644050::bigint, null::bigint, 4677::bigint, 7621450743::bigint, 'The context is that we are about to commence a complete redesign of our platform end to end. This will involve both back end and front end work (back end requires complex SQL with a thin ruby API layer and front end in react - but it may make sense for our in house team to focus on the back end given their knowledge of the platform). There will also be some partly standalone workstreams such a building an in app messaging module to allow collaboration around data and tasks, and developing lightweight android and iOS apps (a wrapper of our web app) which we want to deliver this collaboration/ messaging. This is where I am thinking your team could fit in well. 
Separately we are also keen to kick off a workstream on data acquisition  including building connectors into common databases and building a GUI on top of our ETL tool. This workstream would require a PM though and some UX design since our PM and design team are at capacity working on the first workstream.', 'MK', '2020-05-25 09:24'),
  (17740681718::bigint, null::bigint, 3872::bigint, 7667570110::bigint, 'This is not something we’re in the market for but I wish you the best of luck.', 'MK', '2020-05-25 09:50'),
