  (17740570603::bigint, 7545055676::bigint, 4835::bigint, 7667791575::bigint, 'Some additional info re our discussion yesterday.
Attaching the 3 month roadmap and the broader set of issues here and attached. The product we are shipping is here (by 15 July, just for ongoing monitoring of risks):
https://xd.adobe.com/view/a08fe929-bfa6-4896-55c9-953b838b5791-d6be/
Password: Factmata123
https://covid19.staging.factmata.com/

Kubeflow pipeline is here along with latest docs we have:
Biggest issues are:Pipeline can''t handle different ML pipelines/clustering techniques for different topics and data typesPipeline can''t cluster things daily and track narratives daily (it is just a sequence of batch input/outputs) i.e. we should be able to see narratives evolve and new opinions be assigned to old narratives from the pastNo concept of parallel processing across all the dataNo concept of having different time period ingestion for different data typesLet me know your thoughts.', 'MK', '2020-06-04 06:43'),
