  (17740399309::bigint, 7544856002::bigint, 5085::bigint, 7667791581::bigint, 'Hi Mariana, 

Of course, comments below. 

Uptech 
This proposal was shortlisted as one of our top five but was filtered out for two reasons: 
The proposed tech stack was not our preferred approach. Though not a major issue, it did disadvantage the proposal in comparison to others. 
The case studies provided for other HealthTech projects weren''t as relevant as we would''ve hoped. Other proposals evidenced work with CMS platforms and chatbots which gave us more confidence in their experience. 
The detail provided around the methodologies and ways of working was helpful in shortlisting the proposal, and the detail around security, quality assurance and delivery risks was very welcome. 

Gecko 
The proposal from Gecko seemed to be less detailed and did not provide any case studies. We felt the costs proposed were optimistic for the complexity and timeframe of the project and expect these would''ve increased as we delved into more detail. 


As a side note, you were one of the few companies who took the time to ask questions about the product which certainly gave your proposals an upper hand. I''d welcome your responses to any future RFPs we publish. 

Best,
Jessica', 'MK', '2020-06-22 03:15'),
