  (17739396538::bigint, 7545171174::bigint, 6352::bigint, null::bigint, 'Chris Bushell confirmed that he has decided to re-hire his furloughed DevOps employee instead of adding to the Kyiv team.  His justification was due to the furloughed employees years of prior experience at Reevoo being a gap filler for Chris'' lack of experience at Reevoo. He expects he will need to expand the team in Kyiv and asked that we reconnect in July.', 'AB', '2020-07-06 03:45'),
  (17740643023::bigint, 16332887745::bigint, 5263::bigint, 7667875292::bigint, 'Call with Lawrence confirmed that he has spend the last two months dramatically downsizing LO3 and spinning-off a new venture.&nbsp; No immediate hiring needs at the moment.&nbsp; Check back in August.', 'AB', '2020-07-07 06:56'),
  (17740399307::bigint, 7544896967::bigint, 4834::bigint, 7667816928::bigint, 'NEED:
GT to help build the MVP and potentially continue to work after. Michael Pappas is developing an app with ETFication and is looking for either working on a turn key project or with a combination of a team that can work on an hourly/monthly rate. He is very tight on budget as he wants to build an MVP before raising any money.

Description: 
ETFication is building a gamified investing and education app, that will utilize financial algorithms to help users select portfolios which it will track, alert, and present on. We''re looking for someone with experience developing IOS applications in React Native, and proficient with JavaScript frameworks and libraries.

And here''s a bit longer version: The Company ETFication is developing Portfolio Shepherd, a simple and transparent professional quality tool built on core concepts in modern portfolio theory, and catered to the beginner. It can be used as a complement to the countless options out there to help you to become more informed and in better control of your finances. 
Our goal is to educate and empower our users. 

Position Description
You will be responsible for extending ETFication’s core UI IOS application to include additional features, and facilitate its release in the app store. Features will include gated functionality only available after in-app purchases.  

Work independently to design and implement new functionality into ETFication’s core product. • Review code for correctness, security, and quality and assist in getting code production ready. • Participate in design discussions with manager and domain experts and assess feasibility of new products and features. 
Qualifications 
• Strong CS fundamentals (data structures, algorithms, performance characteristics) with a BS or graduate degree in Computer Science or related discipline. 
• Proficient understanding of JavaScript frameworks and libraries (e.g.,React/Redux). 
• Knowledge of chart library, animation, screen transition would be a plus. 
• Experience in developing IOS application in React Native is a must.', 'MK', '2020-07-14 06:01'),
