  (17740797419::bigint, 16606202577::bigint, 4109::bigint, 7667826619::bigint, 'Searle is a chartered accountant
used to have a business selling and implementing accounting systems (i.e. Sun Systems / SAP Business – not SAGE / Xero)
Aiming at 20M to 100M turnover clients 
14 years then sold it.

Since then financial consultancy
Sometimes 1 day per week or month or to produce an investor deck
They always need monthly reporting and never happy with it
e.g.  BRUM Client – 15M turnover and they have a 15 page board pack / can take me 3 days per month to produce (charging them £850 per day)

Thought that there must be an answer for £1M to £10M market
so I trialed all of these products to see if there is an automated offering and I realised they are rubbish
so building a product

pal with a software company in San Fran recommended these guys in Ukraine;
POLY TECH SOFTWARE
They have 300 devs

Nov 2019 – happy with what they produced (very specific on look and feel)
95% is good
BUT they didn’t understand cashflow / balance sheet etc…which was painful – had to educate them

Then in June, they finished a working model with some functionality.
Then Dad passed away and stopped for a time…it was anatural break (6 weeks) then when wanted to resume, they had moved the Devs onto other projects
No warning that the staff would be redeployed
The PM (who is good) is still around (Artem) and a girl who does UI and design

20th Aug – told them I wanted to get going again and nothing yet on new devs.
Will be 2 or 3 years continuous dev / But 3 or 4 months will need a real push.
Thought they could get a team in 3 weeks and 1 month in and found nobody and Searle is concerned

Said if you can’t find others, may need to make a change – if don’t find others soon.
Have 30 or 40 bits of functionality so would be at least a 12 months / maybe not full time. 
 
What are you being charged now?
3 levels
$30 per hour
$28 for next
£22 for the UI girl 
All are fulltime employees and they are not contractors
Searle owns the IP and on 30 days notice. 

Blend is - $28 UDS per hour.  
Good cost….really happy with this

Spent 85k for 9 months dev.  and investors are very happy.
UK Houses were 800 per day

If in 2 or 3 weeks time – it’s a problem…
Feeling gun against my head…

Given 10 demo’s – all clients say they will buy it.', 'MK', '2020-09-24 08:18'),
