  (17739076320::bigint, null::bigint, 4712::bigint, 7667791343::bigint, 'We''re building the customer portal for IONOS where customers can manage their products, shop new products and get support. The customer portal is built as a distributed web application based on Java, JavaScript, HTML & CSS. At moment the customer portal is developed by four cross functions teams. We would like to expand our team with an external cross functional team and therefore look for a team of about 4 Java web developers (Frontend & Backend) and&nbsp;&nbsp;1 Person for QA. Looking at your offerings the extended team seems like a fit but a project team could also work for the start.', 'MK', '2021-04-05 08:39'),
