Three possible opportunities for work.  The first two would be within Q2.  UX/UI Project team work to produce wireframe, illustrative example to investors and customers of  Waterhound features and benefits.Solution Architect freelance work to review current AI stack.Once funding is in place (Q3''21)Small team initially of between 1 and 3 ETMS.  They currently have 13 employees of which 7 are tech devs.  TM are looking to start with a team of 3 Snr DSs.

