  (17739075823::bigint, 7544967869::bigint, 4169::bigint, 7667826400::bigint, 'Hello,
 
For the project information, descriptions, durations, and role types please look below.
 
Project No. 1
Project Name (Confidential not to be shared) – SWAD Parkwide Game
Project Alias (To be shared) – Parkwide Interactive Game
Project Duration: 10.5 Months
Project Description: The Guardian Games is a world’s first in theme park entertainment. This interactive game connects players directly with the park as they progress through their own role play story that goes beyond a standard mobile app. Players will interact with highly themed game stations located around the park and level up towards earning opportunities allowing them to have real-world influences on their surroundings. The game is fully integrated with all aspects of the theme park, from live entertainment , thematic props and even retail.
Technology Description: Leveraging a distributed nodal architecture guests will take part in integrated mini games ranging from depth tracking-based exploration games, scavenger hunts and controller based gameplay. Guests are identified through RFID-based wearables and lanyards and accounts are associated to an optional mobile phone application that’s front end is mirrored in in-park kiosk units.
Profiles Requested: Backend Developer (3 – Middle &amp; Junior), Unity Developer (2 – Middle &amp; Junior), ReactNative Developer (3 Middle &amp; Junior)
Profile Job Descriptions: https://we.tl/t-Jl27KpraOU
 
Project No. 2
Project Name (Confidential not to be shared) – Mixed Fitness Studio 1
Project Alias (To be shared) – Next Generation Boutique Fitness Studio
