At the end of month 1, with input from the architect and the rest of the teamreview whether we should start again on the code base review whether to replace any teams / team members with GT resources / totally outsourceWith the exception of the first three roles the rest are aligned to Andre''s resourcing plan for 2026.', 'VS', '2026-01-30 09:51'),
