  (-151006306526::bigint, 151006306526::bigint, 'We''re working on a new outbound campaign and could use some help vetting the accounts we plan to target. I''ve outlined the general scope below:
Objective: Identify 100 UK target accounts that meet Vodori''s ideal customer profile (ICP) criteria. 
