  (-120572981491::bigint, 120572981491::bigint, 'John and Andy, I want to make an introduction to Professor Roger Halliday who is CEO of Research Data Scotland. RDS is a keeper and curator of public sector data in Scotland. Link to web site attached.  https://www.researchdata.scot/

