Given this, considering carrying out an independent audit. We are concerned about the lack of resilience in our infrastructure and the potential impact if this issue isn''t resolved quickly. We recently reviewed their major incident report, and I found it to be quite basic, with many key details missing.

 

I know you''re already working on the IaaS discovery, and it would be great to potentially extend this to include Azure services as well.

 

Please let me know if there is an opportunity to discuss this further, and we can set up a call to explore it.', 'JH', '2025-01-27 07:14'),
