  (-15453305044::bigint, 15453305044::bigint, 'We’re being supported by Scottish Enterprise to apply for some funds to develop the Feasibility Analysis of our FastReach (customer interface/software) product. 
 
Broad project outline
 
SGS proposing R&D project to develop innovative modelling software that will enable SGS FastRig customers to seamlessly adopt FastRigs through a lease-finance arrangement, supported by a full-service customer proposition that includes insurance, operation and maintenance,seamless regulatory compliance.
FastReach is expected to factor in an array of information including verified fuel/GHG saving (performance) information for FastRig alongside specific vessel details, charter routes, financial/payment arrangements, planned and unforeseen maintenance, insurance, certification of regulatory compliance etc. 
The intention is to create a seamless, easy-to-access, derisked commercial proposition where SGS customers have easy access to new fuel-saving technology overcoming first-mover fears to wingsail adoption.  
 
Scottish Enterprise will intro us to The Data Lab – Scotland’s  – and it is strategically prudent for us to include them. And/but can you see any merit in us spending some time with your people with a view to collaboration?
 
We’re also looking to recruit a ‘Digital Systems Manager’ to help us lead on various software developments across all of our products – if you happen to know someone.', 'AB', '2024-07-09 08:35'),
