  (-11801872369::bigint, 11801872369::bigint, 'Zeki is up and running and starting to release products into the market. We are getting good take up and coverage, featuring heavily in the recent Financial Times Big Read article on AI talent wars.

I am delighted to introduce you to Rachel, our Head of Data, as we would like to explore with you the potential of using your services later this year as and when we scale operations.', 'JH', '2024-03-26 09:09'),
  (-11558396386::bigint, 11558396386::bigint, 'Apologies for radio silence. I had a week-long annual conference last week that takes part in France every year. It always costs about 2 weeks of diary and one month of health regime just to get a week in the sun talking bollocks.

I enjoyed the UWL session despite it being quite Tech focussed, plenty of cross-over. I have a better understanding now of what the HUB does. I like what they are doing and I can see other ways we can help them.

In respect of the GSK digital Twin I think this is something we are increasingly likely to be commencing  in the next couple of months. We are still going through a (stage zero) process of assessing how much of the existing building we will try to retain and the level of political strategy required in respect of this will  have a bearing on the level of detail we need and hence our budget for ‘creating’ a digital GSK House. We had I interesting meeting with BYD (EV car maker) the day after the UWL gig which was very interesting. There may be scope for few acres given over for a ‘tech’ hub of some kind as well.

Give me another month or so and I’d love to have a chat with you guys about our direction of travel. I am convinced there will be some element of GSK that you will be able to help us with. Happy to get something in the diary now for mid-late April.', 'JH', '2024-03-18 11:21'),
  (-11555727053::bigint, 11555727053::bigint, '6 roles', 'AB', '2024-03-18 08:52'),
  (-11553822425::bigint, 11553822425::bigint, 'As per our discussion, I have followed up with Nikita and we are comfortable offering you an arrangement as follows for Gareths advisory CISO services

8 days engagement during April to carry out the critical defining and establishing of processes to meet Myogenes GDPR requirements

