Any additional hours needed each month will be billable - if for example you need to do a particular audit for a client or have an incident to manage, you might need to draw on additional services.

Total cost for the 12 days (8 days up front plus 8 half days retained) is £13500

As per your request we would be happy to offer you the ability to spread the payments from April to December at a rate of £1500 per month', 'JH', '2024-03-18 08:15'),
