At this stage he is thinking to start with a team up to 10 FTE''s.

Company in question is providing software predominantly to Pharma sector, hence I thought there might be some synergies later on....', 'AB', '2024-02-15 04:29'),
  (-10906140117::bigint, 10906140117::bigint, 'As we discussed, due to your own analytics with iMi and the future potential link with Mangabey access to a delivery team for IT solutions and in particular AI could be helpful to your business aspirations.

Let me introduce John and Michael who are leading the charge of GT LifeScience into the marketplace that is our sector.', 'JH', '2024-02-13 06:37'),
  (-10905002696::bigint, 10905002696::bigint, 'I wanted to approach you to get some understanding on GT services, specifically into Testing Stream. We at TMS are looking for QA resources to work on some upcoming promotions that involve testing effort for 6 - 10 weeks on mobile and web applications starting in late March or early April.
Can you please share some details on GT''s testing expertise and also approximate pricing for senior and junior testers, so it will help us understand and review further. 

To give a high-level view on the ideal candidates, below are some points I wanted to share on the requirements at our end:
Expertise in Mobile & Web app Testing.
Expertise in JIRA & Defect Management.
Effective documentation of test cases ensuring the coverage.
Expertise in planning & executing various types of testing during and post active development.
Communicating the risks effectively to the team. Plan and propose mitigations as applicable.
Collaboration with cross functions to understand requirements and contribute towards greater quality.
Understanding/Expertise in addressing testing across multiple mobile devices using Browser stack or similar other tools.', 'JH', '2024-02-13 03:58'),
  (-10683177921::bigint, 10683177921::bigint, 'We potentially onboard a new MMP client (based in China)

Therefore looking for a ServiceNow Developer.

Could you investigate whether what the cost would be to recruit a SNOW developer who speaks Mandarin please?', 'JH', '2024-01-30 07:20'),
  (-10681472995::bigint, 10681472995::bigint, 'I have prioritized a Sr Java Engineer role and attached a JD for it for us to begin right away. There will be a handful of other roles as a fast follow (Java, QA). We’ll start recruiting this role immediately, with hiring expectations by end of March. The other roles hired by end of April.', 'JH', '2024-01-30 05:12'),
  (-10648495352::bigint, 10648495352::bigint, 'Onymos provided detailed explanations of their technical capabilities, including IoT solutions for medical devices, OCR for digitizing paper forms, and other pre-built features. We discussed specific use cases and client projects, such as Vapotherm and the University of Cincinnati, to illustrate how their platform can be utilized.', 'JH', '2024-01-27 04:49'),
  (-10634261704::bigint, 10634261704::bigint, 'Notes after Andy''s dinner with Jeff (3 June):

It''s moving forward but it will be a slow moving account.', 'AB', '2024-01-26 03:24'),
  (-10621817050::bigint, 10621817050::bigint, 'It will be a full-stack position. Someone with good experience who is close to senior level.', 'AB', '2024-01-25 04:51'),
  (-10610594002::bigint, 10610594002::bigint, 'Frank would prefer for the engineer to be on PT hours, and I know you mentioned quality would be compromised if that''s the case. The before 9 a.m. PT appointments would be challenging, based on when our engineers come into the office.

I''ll let you know if anything changes with regards to hours. As we become larger, I''m sure that will happen.', 'AB', '2024-01-24 06:55'),
  (-10597633763::bigint, 10597633763::bigint, 'We are now very much in build mode for this quarter - so It would be great if we could organise a slot to discuss the requirements we have and to see if it''s something that we could progress together', 'AB', '2024-01-23 06:19'),
  (-10581040608::bigint, 10581040608::bigint, 'We are ready to sprint so would love to get a zoom meeting scheduled to talk through a bit more detail on where we stand, what needs to happen and your different service offerings.', 'AB', '2024-01-22 07:23'),
  (-10504594650::bigint, 10504594650::bigint, 'After internal discussion, we think we will first need to focus on our current client-based expansion/projects while thoughtfully initiating our product vision for the future of bioXcelerate. We will certainly reach out when we have initiated/formalized this to further the conversation with your team.', 'JH', '2024-01-19 04:32'),
  (-10483946468::bigint, 10483946468::bigint, 'hiring 1 ETM', 'AB', '2024-01-17 11:36'),
  (-10455832019::bigint, 10455832019::bigint, 'I’d like to collect our thoughts on direction and overall positioning and then share those with before we start investing more in the tech side of the biz. We are fired up bc we have a few contracts that we need to see through first!', 'AB', '2024-01-15 11:58'),
  (-10427965407::bigint, 10427965407::bigint, 'She had seen GT Life Science on my Linkedin and wanted to learn more.', 'JH', '2024-01-12 10:07'),
