  (-10379897833::bigint, 10379897833::bigint, 'lead generation need', 'JH', '2024-01-08 10:42'),
  (-10353091020::bigint, 10353091020::bigint, '1-2 Back-end Developers ETM (C# .NET)  + 1 (possibly) Front-end (Angular) ETM', 'JH', '2024-01-05 03:57'),
  (-10334069740::bigint, 10334069740::bigint, 'remind about dates in March to have a lunch with Andy and John', 'AB', '2024-01-03 09:34'),
  (-10211072725::bigint, 10211072725::bigint, 'Sarah said: Hi Andy, Unfortunately I do not support Nick and I have emailed him asking him to reach out to you directly.', 'AB', '2023-12-20 04:31'),
  (-10007252162::bigint, 10007252162::bigint, 'Migration program, bring AI into Optegra', 'JH', '2023-12-04 10:18'),
  (-9888629227::bigint, 9888629227::bigint, '2 Full-stack ETMs', 'AB', '2023-11-24 03:03'),
  (-9802469069::bigint, 9802469069::bigint, 'issues with Senior Leadership team, eager to  to start sessions with GT to understand the current state of various projects. Potential transition to a new vendor', 'JH', '2023-11-17 09:35'),
  (-9707960280::bigint, 9707960280::bigint, 'we shared presentation, no reply from Stuart for long time', 'JH', '2023-11-09 10:06'),
  (-9282579131::bigint, 9282579131::bigint, 'I chatted to Ben and our Kaluza Flex leadership team at the end of last week. We think the best starting point to consider a hybrid team approach would be to support the joint venture we are discussing entering into. This would launch in April 2024 and as mentioned this is highly confidential even within Kaluza.

I''ve attached a high-level outline of our potential requirements in the area. Hopefully it is clear and enables you to come up with an initial outline incl. a rough quote and set of clarification questions? One thing that would be helpful would be for you to share an option with the TL supplied by you (as per the document) and one where the TL is a Kaluza FTE (and any implications that would have from your pov on the effectiveness of the team).

