  (-8885495742::bigint, 8885495742::bigint, 'Yes, I’ve had a chance to look through them. They are quite data science focussed specifically, and I think what our team would need would be more on the generalist side. I’ll forward the CVs onto Arrie, the head of digital services, as an FYI for him.

 

